{"w":2400,"h":3106,"lines":[{"c":1,"w":0.059594306945800812,"y":0.069713478361115966,"x":0.78507197825475827,"t":"Test 4","h":0.018243617728995409},{"w":0.62406016031901035,"t":"Now, let me tell you something about the different ski trails you can follow during your","y":0.11773255786222914,"x":0.07330826570796195,"h":0.015988372635703185,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.073188852189199918,"t":"stay here.","h":0.013947615221248322,"y":0.1347413086339998,"w":0.077306505839029968},{"h":0.01879532415484586,"w":0.72565800984700524,"c":1,"t":"Highland Trail's directly accessible from where we are now. This trail's been designed to give Q17","x":0.07326844046818716,"y":0.15550019472711341},{"y":0.17289117816238997,"x":0.073308272111031789,"w":0.65413533528645829,"h":0.014608821635544111,"c":1,"t":"first-timers an experience they'll enjoy regardless of their age or skill, but it's also ideal for"},{"y":0.1889534884153008,"h":0.013235822310389445,"w":0.2518797047932943,"x":0.073308267760127777,"c":1,"t":"experts to practise their technique"},{"x":0.073253667912981657,"y":0.20927019766011556,"t":"Then there's Pine Trail... if you're nervous about skiing, leave this one to the experts!","w":0.62608184814453116,"h":0.01887588476413149,"c":1},{"y":0.22665808105968954,"t":"You follow a steep valley looking right down on the river below - scary! But if you've fully","x":0.073308283199634547,"c":1,"w":0.64661651611328119,"h":0.01462098850562199},{"c":1,"x":0.76315789441579185,"t":"Q18","y":0.22674418606516111,"w":0.03571428616841632,"h":0.013081395234588844},{"w":0.40225563049316404,"t":"mastered the techniques needed for hills, it's great fun.","c":1,"x":0.07330827488847784,"h":0.014534883321060788,"y":0.24273255833562435},{"c":1,"y":0.26405228554512483,"w":0.65800506591796881,"x":0.07325797167474718,"t":"Stony Trail's a good choice once you've got a general idea of the basics. There are one or","h":0.017486113543980331},{"t":"two tricky sections, but nothing too challenging. There's a shelter half-way where you can sit","w":0.67491521199544269,"x":0.073258337884317182,"h":0.017498246025286823,"y":0.27940365865171413,"c":1},{"h":0.015988371407532731,"y":0.27906976774019354,"c":1,"x":0.76315789482211915,"w":0.037593984603881858,"t":"Q19"},{"w":0.37969924926757809,"t":"and take a break and enjoy the afternoon sunshine.","c":1,"h":0.014534883321060788,"x":0.073308270006382792,"y":0.29651162810275866},{"x":0.07330826981651635,"y":0.31970379888223277,"h":0.014598526497157427,"w":0.67293233235677075,"c":1,"t":"And finally, Loser's Trail. This starts off following a gentle river valley but the last part is quite"},{"x":0.073218685580846224,"c":1,"y":0.33217677642439913,"w":0.66940388997395839,"h":0.020170529888126065,"t":"exposed so the snow conditions can be challenging - if it's snowing or windy, check with us"},{"y":0.33430232559964401,"w":0.035714286168416431,"x":0.76315789467425044,"c":1,"t":"Q20","h":0.014534883321060788},{"x":0.073308278183238831,"w":0.40977442423502602,"h":0.014535819186906496,"t":"before you set out to make sure the trail's open that day","y":0.35028976186315885,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"Right, so now if you'd like to follow me, we'll get started..","x":0.073308275359925873,"h":0.016097875080489432,"y":0.37347070192070686,"w":0.41917292277018225},{"x":0.075187971696422884,"c":1,"t":"SECTION 3","y":0.43168604670174182,"w":0.14097743988037109,"h":0.014547050805223893},{"x":0.12030074643096673,"w":0.46052632649739583,"y":0.45930232577828933,"h":0.014619116773930796,"c":1,"t":"I've still got loads to do for our report on nutritional food labels."},{"c":1,"h":0.020412537795224672,"t":"ALICE: Me too. What did you learn from doing the project about your own shopping habits?","x":0.073215500570863845,"y":0.47232893128833209,"w":0.65999506632486993},{"h":0.01481004507405026,"c":1,"t":"Well, I've always had to check labels for traces of peanuts in everything I eat because","y":0.48969735998756447,"x":0.12406014524273094,"w":0.62406016031901046},{"w":0.67489298502604167,"c":1,"h":0.017454307001019354,"t":"of my allergy. But beyond that lI've never really been concerned enough to check how Q21","x":0.12401170702434722,"y":0.50431872213492168},{"t":"healthy a product is.","c":1,"h":0.013081395234588844,"y":0.52180232563002515,"w":0.15037593841552732,"x":0.1240601509953415},{"x":0.071428571643685934,"c":1,"t":"ALICE:","w":0.045112781524658196,"h":0.013081395234588733,"y":0.53779069766613585},{"y":0.53633720950023034,"w":0.67857142130533854,"t":"This project has actually taught me to read the labels much more carefully. Ltended to Q22","h":0.014534883321060788,"c":1,"x":0.12030075541902192},{"x":0.12401027520188393,"c":1,"w":0.6316816202799479,"y":0.55002987973809303,"t":"believe claims on packaging like 'low in fat\". But I now realise that the 'healthy' yoghurt","h":0.016989376340769025},{"c":1,"t":"I've bought for years is full of sugar and that it's actually quite high in calories","x":0.12406014776377869,"y":0.56686046530786049,"w":0.56203008015950517,"h":0.014594782419689811},{"t":"Ready meals are the worst... comparing the labels on supermarket pizzas was a real","w":0.62969924926757814,"y":0.58274307781155243,"h":0.014640642916549762,"c":1,"x":0.11842105196509105},{"x":0.12406015245058105,"t":"eye-opener. Did you have any idea how many calories they contain? I was amazed.","w":0.61090225219726557,"c":1,"h":0.01481004507405026,"y":0.5972311657728443},{"t":"ALICE: Yes, because unless you read the label really carefully, you wouldn't know that the","y":0.61332904032140378,"w":0.65225565592447909,"x":0.073308262169976504,"h":0.014577936220383947,"c":1},{"x":0.76315789442166593,"h":0.013081395234588733,"c":1,"w":0.03571428616841632,"t":"Q23","y":0.61337209303950069},{"c":1,"w":0.31578946431477861,"x":0.12406015520325374,"t":"nutritional values given are for half a pizza.","y":0.62781712827111702,"h":0.014624731969004268},{"c":1,"x":0.12218044548901522,"y":0.6438953490344016,"h":0.014534883321060788,"t":"When most people eat the whole pizza. Not exactly transparent is it?","w":0.5037594095865886},{"x":0.073308262945886896,"t":"ALICE: Not at all. But I expect it won't stop you from buying pizza?","c":1,"y":0.65840309094555405,"w":0.47932332356770835,"h":0.016097875080489321},{"w":0.03759398460388183,"y":0.67732558144711963,"h":0.010174418447559619,"c":1,"t":"JACK:","x":0.073308270757022273},{"x":0.12406014875225167,"h":0.014570448679534054,"c":1,"y":0.67441860484879046,"t":"Probably not, no! I thought comparing the different labelling systems used by food","w":0.5958646647135416},{"h":0.01613343982487736,"c":1,"t":"manufacturers was interesting. I think the kind of labelling system used makes a big","y":0.68895348851498373,"x":0.12406016565840881,"w":0.60902252197265627},{"h":0.0142177562136383,"y":0.70493961002454131,"t":"difference.","w":0.079570604960123692,"c":1,"x":0.12378041558155725},{"t":"ALICE: Which one did you prefer?","x":0.071283973138563259,"y":0.71920947143497682,"h":0.017775183712676168,"c":1,"w":0.24661323547363279},{"c":1,"w":0.62794845581054681,"h":0.016851452804732436,"y":0.7348621794622614,"x":0.12210875592632239,"t":"I liked the traditional daily value system best - the one which tells you what proportion"},{"h":0.014539563264374,"c":1,"t":"of your required daily intake of each ingredient the product contains. I'm not sure it's.","y":0.75144880862478636,"x":0.12406015633218392,"w":0.61654134114583337},{"t":"Q24","w":0.03571428616841632,"x":0.76315789441579185,"y":0.75145348839074244,"h":0.013081395234588844,"c":1},{"w":0.59586466471354171,"x":0.12406014875043851,"t":"the easiest for people to use but at least you get the full story. I like to know all the","h":0.013081395234588733,"c":1,"y":0.76744186052013741},{"h":0.014546114325293069,"w":0.56015040079752598,"c":1,"t":"ingredients in a product - not just how much fat, salt and sugar they contain.","y":0.78197674437960618,"x":0.12218043849122509},{"t":"But it's good supermarkets have been making an effort to provide reliable information","y":0.79632252849030072,"w":0.62414179484049481,"h":0.017327222068771908,"x":0.12026849326227354,"c":1},{"t":"for customers.","w":0.10937049865722658,"h":0.013322618954886289,"y":0.81309189380871039,"x":0.12202564225862024,"c":1},{"w":0.03759398460388183,"h":0.011627907148116789,"c":1,"x":0.071428571519377093,"y":0.82994186034523032,"t":"JACK:"},{"y":0.82839665191097145,"c":1,"x":0.12218043955953997,"h":0.014626603700695573,"t":"Yes. There just needs to be more consistency between labelling systems used by","w":0.59398498535156252},{"h":0.01481004507405026,"w":0.38345865885416663,"t":"different supermarkets, in terms of portion sizes, etc.","y":0.84288473926657026,"x":0.12218044488669766,"c":1},{"h":0.014563897004529647,"y":0.85898261442119261,"x":0.071428559484333548,"c":1,"w":0.68045115152994784,"t":"ALICE: Mmm. The labels on the different brands of chicken flavour crisps were quite revealing"},{"x":0.12194516980792949,"w":0.13403564453125003,"y":0.87416978165865555,"c":1,"t":"too, weren't they?","h":0.015867348724384889},{"w":0.037593984603881844,"h":0.011627907148116789,"x":0.071428571573657174,"c":1,"t":"JACK:","y":0.89098837195448288},{"x":0.12218044949637999,"y":0.88953488391836766,"h":0.014534883321060788,"w":0.59586466471354171,"c":1,"t":"Yeah. I don't understand how they can get away with calling them chicken flavour"},{"t":"Q25","w":0.033834587732950894,"h":0.013081395234588733,"y":0.88953488373444989,"c":1,"x":0.76315789401573009},{"c":1,"x":0.12218044968921485,"y":0.90552325586633808,"h":0.013081395234588844,"w":0.302631581624349,"t":"when they only contain artificial additives."},{"y":0.94331395354295788,"w":0.03571428616841632,"h":0.014534883321060788,"c":1,"t":"115","x":0.80451127810000234}]}